    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Breath is a third-person extraction shooter set in a near-future, post-apocalyptic world. Players take on high-stakes missions, where survival depends on tactical thinking, adaptation, and teamwork. Built with Unreal Engine 5, the game offers immersive PvPvE experiences in highly detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission begins with preparation: gear up, plan your strategy, and manage resources. Then plunge into an open-world zone filled with AI-driven enemies, hostile NPCs, mutated creatures, and opposing players. Complete objectives, uncover secrets, and extract before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay loop is designed to keep players engaged:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare. Explore. Fulfill. Encounter. Extract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions unfold across multi-biome maps with hidden features and environmental hazards. Use vehicles, customize weapons, loot rare items, and build your path to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Breath supports both solo and team-based play, with PvPvE tension rising in every session. Short 25-minute runs keep gameplay sharp and replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5, Deep Breath delivers cinematic lighting, realistic physics, and scalable visuals across PC and console platforms.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Breath is a third-person extraction shooter set in a near-future, post-apocalyptic world. Players take on high-stakes missions, where survival depends on tactical thinking, adaptation, and teamwork. Built with Unreal Engine 5, the game offers immersive PvPvE experiences in highly detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission begins with preparation: gear up, plan your strategy, and manage resources. Then plunge into an open-world zone filled with AI-driven enemies, hostile NPCs, mutated creatures, and opposing players. Complete objectives, uncover secrets, and extract before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay loop is designed to keep players engaged:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare. Explore. Fulfill. Encounter. Extract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions unfold across multi-biome maps with hidden features and environmental hazards. Use vehicles, customize weapons, loot rare items, and build your path to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Breath supports both solo and team-based play, with PvPvE tension rising in every session. Short 25-minute runs keep gameplay sharp and replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5, Deep Breath delivers cinematic lighting, realistic physics, and scalable visuals across PC and console platforms.</p>",
    "short_description": "Deep Breath is a third-person PvPvE extraction shooter set in a post-apocalyptic world. Team up or play solo, scavenge, fight, and escape in 25-minute missions filled with AI threats, tactical decisions, and fast-paced action.",
